readmes.en:
Merge two types into a new type. Keys of the second type overrides keys of the first type.

For example

```ts
type foo = {
  name: string
  age: string
}
type coo = {
  age: number
  sex: string
}

type Result = Merge<foo, coo> // expected to be {name: string, age: number, sex: string}
```

readmes.zh-CN:
将两个类型合并成一个类型，第二个类型的键会覆盖第一个类型的键。

例如

```ts
type foo = {
  name: string;
  age: string;
}

type coo = {
  age: number;
  sex: string
}

type Result = Merge<foo,coo>; // expected to be {name: string, age: number, sex: string}
```

